    "text": {
     "en": "Families are not all the same. Some are big and some are small.\nBela's family has parents, grandparents, brothers and a dog.\nA big family has many members living together or visiting each other often.\nA small family has few members, for example parents and children.\nIn all families people care for each other.\nCount the members of your family and compare with a friend's family."
